  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The class is proficient with all simple weapons and light armor. They are also proficient with darts as melee weapons (i.e they are improvised weapons that they do not take the normal penalty for).</p>\n<h4>Sidebar: “Needles”</h4>\n<p>A needle is identical to a dart (which is fired from a blowgun).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/acupuncturist-class#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
